==Trivia==
Spearow is one of seven Pokémon in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion featured in the "Touring the Kanto Region" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], in which all of the cards show various elements of the [[Kanto]] region. This card's illustration features Spearow on [[Kanto]] {{rt|16|Kanto}}, with [[Celadon City]] and the [[Celadon Department Store]] in the background, as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}.

===Origin===
*{{m|Peck}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Spearow}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

